      "In a tennis contest, you must win six games to win a set. Then, you must win two sets to win it all. The game goes fast and can be a bit hectic. Do not panic, you will get the hang of it. I must admit, a rapid tennis game is fun to witness. So, grab a friend and give tennis a go!"
